        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "- Remove automatic menu-show and experimental vertical-menu behavior; preserve native horizontal menus.\n- Add editable Search with AI on supported iOS 16+ edit menus with full-query Google AI Mode and browser/Safari routing instead of ordinary universal-link routing.\n- Remove forced English/Vietnamese output language from the AI prompt.\n- Preserve native correction suggestions and validate Select All for supported nonsecure text inputs; retrieve WebKit selection asynchronously without stale clipboard fallback."
        },
